Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.51,0:00:20.70,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,The year is 20XX A.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.41,0:00:23.12,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,When mysterious \Nextraterrestrial lifeforms
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:25.08,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,appeared in the Earth's atmosphere,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:31.84,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,we humans were forced to face \Nan unprecedented threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.45,0:00:49.86,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\an5\fnArial\b1\shad0\c&H47A446&\3c&H81DC91&\bord1.5}gero gero gero gero
