Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.51,0:01:17.35,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,0)\fnArial\b1\fs30\c&H2EFFF3&\3c&H54C509&\shad0}Keroro ☆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.18,0:02:28.84,Ep_Title,text,0,0,0,,{\b1\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\pos(320,180)}The Dangerous {\c&H05E1F8&\3c&H1794E4&}Duo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.19,0:02:25.80,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,"The Dangerous Duo!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.31,0:02:27.74,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.74,0:02:28.86,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Gero gero!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.16,0:02:37.39,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,Oh, really? So you like to come to \Nthis park to look for skyfish too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.39,0:02:38.63,Main,Momoka,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.63,0:02:42.58,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,But isn't it a neat coincidence to run \Ninto a friend on the weekend like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.58,0:02:44.58,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,I guess we're just lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.58,0:02:47.00,Main,Momoka,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, what a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.38,0:02:49.23,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,It was absolutely not a coincidence!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.62,0:02:54.33,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,With the Nishizawa Group's satellites and \Ndata infrastructure at her fingertips...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.65,0:02:57.74,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,Due to privacy concerns, \Nperhaps I'll leave it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.65,0:03:03.11,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,"Even a setup can seem a miracle \Nif you aren't aware it was staged."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.11,0:03:04.25,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,By Mutsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.50,0:03:07.02,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,Won't you buy one?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.65,0:03:09.71,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,One of my drawings?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.71,0:03:10.90,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.25,0:03:11.73,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(925,550)\pos(30,158)\an7\b1\fs40\fnArial\c&H418FF4&\3c&HD2FFF5&\shad0\bord3\be1}Zing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.31,0:03:13.76,Italics,Fuyuki (M),0,0,0,,Wh-Why is my heart pounding?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.77,0:03:13.76,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,0)\pos(496,18)\an9\fnArial\b1\c&H8785F5&\bord0\shad0}Ba-dump\NBa-dump
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.66,0:03:16.88,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,D-Did you draw these?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.12,0:03:19.14,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.47,0:03:22.39,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnArial\b1\fs18\c&H3D4337&\3c&HF5F1EF&\shad0}It ain't Donkey Hotay,\Nit's Don Quixote, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.72,0:03:24.39,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,How can you make such fantastic art? \NYou must be really talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.85,0:03:27.75,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,Talented? No, not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.75,0:03:31.52,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,I just close my eyes and \Nwait to pick up the signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.97,0:03:34.65,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,And then I smash that onto the page.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.49,0:03:39.40,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,The fact that you and I are talking now
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.14,0:03:42.92,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,must mean that you received my signal too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.95,0:03:46.04,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1300,0)\move(570,82,570,54,23,1356)\an2\b1\bord5\shad0\fs28\c&H4F5CE5&\3c&HC07561&}Mutsumi
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.95,0:03:46.04,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1300,0)\move(570,82,570,54,23,1356)\an2\b1\bord3\shad0\fs28\c&H4F5CE5&\3c&HFCFCFC&}Mutsumi
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.01,0:03:46.04,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1350,0)\3c&HEC6370&\shad0\pos(516,136)\fs20}Mu
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.01,0:03:46.04,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1350,0)\3c&HEC6370&\shad0\pos(516,193)\fs20}Tsu
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.01,0:03:46.04,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1350,0)\3c&HEC6370&\shad0\pos(516,276)\fs20}Mi
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.45,0:03:45.02,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,My name is Mutsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.02,0:03:46.04,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,Nice to meet ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.91,0:03:50.79,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,He seems really suspicious. \NWe should split.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.79,0:03:52.23,Main,Momoka,0,0,0,,Uh, s-sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.61,0:03:55.84,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,Huh... You guys make a great couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.84,0:03:57.80,Main,Momoka,0,0,0,,How much for all of them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.80,0:04:00.97,Main,Paul,0,0,0,,If you take cash, you can name your price.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.59,0:04:04.08,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,Come back anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.31,0:04:08.07,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,Well, see you later, Nishizawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.07,0:04:10.69,Main,Momoka,0,0,0,,S-S-See you later, Hinata-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.03,0:04:17.56,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,I can't put my finger on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.56,0:04:20.92,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,but there's something really \Nsuspicious about that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.37,0:04:25.38,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,"Reunited with," times "suspicious guy," \Ndivided by "coincidence"...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.00,0:04:28.26,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,could that possibly equal destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.26,0:04:29.46,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.26,0:04:29.46,Main - Top,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,By Mutsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.27,0:04:32.33,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,Well, I wish it were that simple...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.59,0:04:37.59,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,but I was actually waiting to catch \Nyou alone, Hinata Fuyuki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.59,0:04:40.41,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,H-How do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.47,0:04:42.39,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,That's my little secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.04,0:04:46.73,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,Yeah. I have little secrets, \Njust like I know you do too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.73,0:04:47.81,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.86,0:04:47.81,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(375,0)\c&H7B7C13&\fnArial\b1\fs30\bord0\shad0\pos(445.333,6)}Jolt!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.06,0:04:53.17,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,You're hiding something really big that \Nyou can't tell anybody about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.17,0:04:54.02,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.02,0:04:58.03,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\an9\fnArial\b1\fs22\c&H7DB1CB&\bord1\4c&HC2CEDB&}Yes, I am a top breeder\Nof space aliens!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.02,0:04:58.03,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,R-Ridiculous! Why would \Nyou say such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.03,0:05:02.03,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,Because you keep sending signals that \Nset my radar buzzing like crazy...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.68,0:05:06.79,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,signals saying your life right now is \Nfull of dangers and wild mysteries!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.04,0:05:08.95,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,Kaboom!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.29,0:05:08.79,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\an8\fnArial\b1\c&H3894F3&\3c&HD2F4F7&\shad0}Full of dangers and wild mysteries!!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.47,0:05:08.95,Main,Giroro,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.55,0:05:13.40,Italics,Fuyuki (M),0,0,0,,Who is this guy? \NDoes he really know what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.40,0:05:15.96,Italics,Fuyuki (M),0,0,0,,Is he a secret government spy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.96,0:05:19.94,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,To be straight with you, I know \Nthere's something in your house—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.04,0:05:23.39,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,You won't get away that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.93,0:05:25.93,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(68,218)\frz326.2\fax-.1\fs12\b1\c&H989898&\3c&HFFFDFF&\shad0}Hinata
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.27,0:05:29.11,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,Warm 'n' fuzzy, cozy-dozy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.68,0:05:34.98,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(487.333,24)\frz7.688\b1\fs22\c&HC49FE6&\3c&HB25AE8&\shad0\bord1.5}cozy-dozy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.11,0:05:30.94,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Warm 'n' fuzzy? Cozy-dozy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.50,0:05:32.68,Main,Giroro,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.39,0:05:34.98,Main,Giroro,0,0,0,,Some kind of Pekoponian ciphertext?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.20,0:05:38.01,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,Hey! Nobody said you could touch those!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.01,0:05:41.36,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,Illustrated poems are really hot right \Nnow. You've never heard of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.98,0:05:46.38,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,They're drawn by Mutsumi-san, \Na really popular illustrated poemer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.38,0:05:48.87,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,He even hosts radio shows now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.87,0:05:50.46,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,The rain will always end.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.26,0:05:56.02,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&HF0A985&\fnArial\b1\3c&HF6F2F1&\shad0\fs18}The rain {\c&HF6E291&}will always end
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.46,0:05:51.95,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,The sun will always rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.72,0:05:56.02,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&HF06FE5&\fnArial\b1\3c&HF6F2F1&\shad0\fs18}The sun {\c&HF277A7&}will always rise
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.95,0:05:53.96,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,The bus will always be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.26,0:05:56.02,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H46CAF6&\fnArial\b1\3c&HF6F2F1&\shad0\fs18\frz0}The bus will {\c&HA078ED&}always be late
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.96,0:05:55.67,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,By Mutsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.02,0:06:00.34,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,Oh, he's just so deep! \NMutsumi blows my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.34,0:06:02.00,Main,Tamama,0,0,0,,If ya say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.00,0:06:04.60,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Sounds fairly shallow to my ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.60,0:06:07.13,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Gero! Something's happening \Nto Corporal Giroro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.92,0:06:10.59,Main,Giroro,0,0,0,,This "Mutsumi" or "Chatsumi" \Nor whatever is a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.10,0:06:16.98,Main,Giroro,0,0,0,,I'll show you what a real \Nman's poem looks like!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.98,0:06:20.86,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&H42493D&\3c&HF6F2F1&\shad0}Big Gun Battleship Doctrine
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.63,0:06:19.99,Main,Giroro,0,0,0,,Big canon battleship doctrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.99,0:06:20.86,Main,Giroro,0,0,0,,By Giroro.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.86,0:06:23.63,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(358,15)\frz13.83\fnArial\b1\fs18\shad0\c&H38E0E6&\3c&HCCF1F3&}Nervous
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.20,0:06:25.64,Main,Tamama,0,0,0,,There, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.58,0:06:26.97,Main - Top,Giroro,0,0,0,,No, not like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.97,0:06:28.99,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,I decided to write one myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.99,0:06:35.00,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H413C36&\3c&HF6F2F1&\shad0\b1\fs18}Dear Shizuoka Factory,\Nplease release a\NMaster Grade Big Zam model.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.33,0:06:34.01,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Dear Shizuoka Factory, please release \Na Master Grade Big Zam model.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.01,0:06:34.98,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,By Keroro.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.98,0:06:37.33,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,That's just a request letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.20,0:06:39.01,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Gero!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.96,0:06:44.05,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,This alert... Oh dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.05,0:06:46.10,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,It's picking up \Na faint mind control signal, yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.10,0:06:46.76,Main,Giroro,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.76,0:06:48.80,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,The source is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.49,0:06:53.48,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,It's coming from the poems!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.35,0:06:56.60,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,Everyone hide! The Black-Clad Men are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.60,0:06:57.01,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Gero!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.01,0:06:58.24,Main,Tamama,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.80,0:07:05.53,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,I've finally found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.79,0:07:08.74,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(320,295)\an2\fnArial\b1\shad0\bord1\fs20}Secret Underground Base Command Center
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.40,0:07:09.76,Main - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,Gero... So who are these "Black-Clad Men"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.76,0:07:11.20,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.20,0:07:12.41,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,The Black-Clad Men are
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.14,0:07:15.48,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,mysterious special agents who \Noperate behind the scenes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.48,0:07:19.24,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,to suppress information about incidents \Ninvolving contact with aliens.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.25,0:07:19.75,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs40\b1\fnArial\fscx120\fscy140\frz10.92\c&H3A26D4&\3c&H272830&\bord4\shad0\move(529,-70,529,0)}C{\fs44}L{\fs40}A{\fs46}D
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.24,0:07:21.99,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,They are prepared to use any \Nmeans to achieve their goals,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.75,0:07:21.38,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs40\b1\fnArial\fscx120\fscy140\frz10.92\c&H3A26D4&\3c&H272830&\bord4\shad0\move(529,0,529,46)}C{\fs44}L{\fs40}A{\fs46}D
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.21,0:07:26.88,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs40\b1\fnArial\fscx120\fscy140\frz10.92\c&H3A26D4&\3c&H272830&\bord4\shad0\move(598,-50,598,49,20,4859)}-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.38,0:07:23.51,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs40\b1\fnArial\fscx120\fscy140\frz10.92\c&H3A26D4&\3c&H272830&\bord4\shad0\move(529,46,529,96)}C{\fs44}L{\fs40}A{\fs46}D
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.99,0:07:25.35,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,including eliminating those \Ninvolved when necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.63,0:07:23.67,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs40\b1\fnArial\fscx120\fscy140\frz10.92\c&H3A26D4&\3c&H272830&\bord4\shad0\pos(529,100)}C{\fs44}L{\fs40}A{\fs46}D
