Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.35,0:07:26.87,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.87,0:07:30.39,Main,Ura-Tamama,0,0,0,,Time to turn on those security \Ncameras you shamelessly installed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.39,0:07:33.37,Main,Ura-Tamama,0,0,0,,after that pretentious speech \Nyou gave last time, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.37,0:07:35.27,Main,Mois,0,0,0,,Switch on! Image incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.38,0:07:39.44,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,I know him! That's Mutsumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.44,0:07:41.42,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,Y-You know him, Sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.42,0:07:42.19,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Gero!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.61,0:07:44.86,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,This scoundrel used poem signals
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.13,0:07:47.40,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,to make contact with \NOfficers Natsumi and Fuyuki
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.40,0:07:49.91,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,and then track them all the way here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.91,0:07:52.62,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,No way! Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.62,0:07:56.31,Italics,Giroro (M),0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for using radio \Nwaves on Natsumi's feelings...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.31,0:07:58.83,Italics,Giroro,0,0,0,,...and leading her on like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.83,0:07:59.61,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,Giroro?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.61,0:08:01.21,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Wait! Don't throw your life away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.46,0:08:05.27,Main,Mois,0,0,0,,Target has stopped at front door \Nand is displaying suspicious behavior!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.27,0:08:07.47,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,Don't worry. The door is locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.47,0:08:10.42,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,I don't think he'd destroy it or \Ndo anything to draw attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.40,0:08:16.85,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.71,0:08:19.59,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Fire the defense missiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.59,0:08:20.35,Main,Mois,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.66,0:08:24.44,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,When in the world did you install those?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.65,0:08:27.05,Main,Mois,0,0,0,,Direct hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.98,0:08:27.05,Main - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,Nice one!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.05,0:08:29.53,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Yuss! Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.52,0:08:31.79,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,What a bangin' welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.79,0:08:32.28,Main,All,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.79,0:08:32.28,Main - Top,All,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.67,0:08:34.81,Main,Mois,0,0,0,,He's unharmed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.81,0:08:37.21,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,No way! Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.97,0:08:39.24,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,You must be...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.08,0:08:43.00,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,It looks like I'm in the right place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.00,0:08:44.66,Main,Giroro,0,0,0,,Shut up, you punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.66,0:08:46.76,Main,Giroro,0,0,0,,I'm never gonna let you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.76,0:08:49.68,Main,Giroro,0,0,0,,take her away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.68,0:08:52.12,Main,Tamama,0,0,0,,Yay, Giroro! Go get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.12,0:08:54.66,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Our very own red dreadnought!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.66,0:08:56.57,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,The house is done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.43,0:09:04.96,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Does it seem to you like Giroro \Nis only here to lose fights?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.96,0:09:07.28,Main,Tamama,0,0,0,,I don't think you're allowed to say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.12,0:09:10.19,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,Downstairs, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.79,0:09:16.99,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,Hey! Will you stop?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.46,0:09:27.67,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,I never would have expected you to \Nassimilate to life with humans already.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.71,0:09:37.89,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,Now, time for your disappearing act.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.83,0:09:40.18,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,No! We're done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.70,0:09:42.59,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Gero!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.59,0:09:43.40,Main,Tamama,0,0,0,,Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.32,0:09:48.23,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,I-Is everyone all right s—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.23,0:09:49.15,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Whoa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.44,0:09:52.63,Main,Kululu,0,0,0,,Ku, ku ku ku ku ku ku!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.63,0:09:56.31,Main,Kululu,0,0,0,,Nice to see you, Commander Keroro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.31,0:09:59.83,Main - Top,Kululu,0,0,0,,Ku ku ku ku ku ku ku ku!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.95,0:09:59.83,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,S-Sergeant Major Kululu?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.95,0:09:59.83,Main,Tamama,0,0,0,,S-Sergeant Major Kululu?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.83,0:10:04.42,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,I had no idea you were also working \Nundercover among the Pekoponians!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.42,0:10:08.46,Main,Kululu,0,0,0,,Ku, ku ku! Well, this guy \Nand I kinda hit it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.91,0:10:11.51,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,In exchange for helping \Nhim find his friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.51,0:10:15.15,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,he lets me use all sorts \Nof mysterious powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.43,0:10:15.15,Main - Top,Kululu,0,0,0,,Ku ku ku!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.15,0:10:18.10,Main,Kululu,0,0,0,,What's a little give-and-take \Nbetween pals, ya know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.10,0:10:20.54,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,U-Um, Sergeant?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.54,0:10:22.02,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.02,0:10:23.77,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(106,6)\b1\fnArial\c&HBEC328&\3c&HF6F9D7&\4c&HB5BB9E&}Kululu
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.02,0:10:23.77,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fnArial\c&HBEC328&\3c&HF6F9D7&\4c&HB5BB9E&\pos(507,40)}Sergeant Major
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.45,0:10:26.15,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Sergeant Major Kululu here is our \Nofficer in charge of communications,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.15,0:10:29.00,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,weapons procurement, and information \Nwarfare. He's our staff officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.00,0:10:34.28,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Or in other words, the big brain \Nbehind the Keroro Platoon, yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.42,0:10:42.04,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H3B3935&\fnArial\b1\bord0\shad0\fs30}boom-tss
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.63,0:10:38.85,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,At long, long last, the fourth member \Nof the Keroro Platoon has arrived,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.85,0:10:42.04,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,and the unit takes one more step forward \Nin their invasion of the planet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.04,0:10:43.87,Italics,Natsumi (M),0,0,0,,There's a fourth one?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.87,0:10:46.11,Italics,Natsumi (M),0,0,0,,How am I gonna \Nkeep up with all of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.11,0:10:48.38,Main,Kululu,0,0,0,,Hey over there, honey girl-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.38,0:10:52.67,Main,Kululu,0,0,0,,I can see you mellowin' out to \Nmy waves! You lookin' good, babe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.67,0:10:55.23,Main,Kululu,0,0,0,,You and I are gonna have \Na real good time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.23,0:10:58.73,Main,Kululu,0,0,0,,Let's get our groove on, baby! Ku, ku ku!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.02,0:11:02.93,Main,Tamama,0,0,0,,One step forward, one step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.24,0:11:04.68,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.68,0:11:06.91,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,Invasion is like multiplication.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.91,0:11:08.95,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,No matter how many comrades you assemble,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.95,0:11:11.23,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,if one of them is a zero, \Nyou end up with nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.23,0:11:12.82,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,By Mutsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.35,0:11:16.45,Main,Kululu,0,0,0,,Ku ku.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.07,0:11:24.06,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,"How About Some Radio Tonight?"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.08,0:11:26.83,Ep_Title,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(925,0)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\b1\pos(320,190)}How About Some {\c&HD7D8D9&}Radio {\c&H6B3708&\3c&HB1D1C2&}Tonight{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&}?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.06,0:11:25.23,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.57,0:11:28.58,Italics,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,Well, that's about it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.04,0:11:32.74,Italics,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,{\i0}Mutsumi's Me Radio{\i1} will be \Nback again next week for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.13,0:11:39.53,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,Even after everything that happened, \NMutsumi-san's DJ poems are so awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.53,0:11:41.94,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,So as you can see, yes sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.94,0:11:44.14,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,we will take this device that has so \Neasily captured Officer Natsumi's heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.14,0:11:46.41,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\3c&HF9FFA7&\shad0\c&HD2C6AD&}Ray-dee-oh
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.14,0:11:48.68,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,this "ray-dee-oh" or what have you, \Nand use it to send mind-control waves
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.68,0:11:51.77,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,that will render the Pekoponians \Ntotally spineless!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.77,0:11:53.78,Main,Giroro,0,0,0,,I-I wish to file my objections!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.78,0:11:56.09,Main,Giroro,0,0,0,,You can't put c-cameras in \NNatsumi's room like that—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.09,0:11:57.33,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Shaddap and listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.95,0:12:00.22,Main,Giroro,0,0,0,,N-Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.84,0:12:03.45,Main,Tamama,0,0,0,,So where do we get the equipment we need?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.78,0:12:06.47,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,We'll leave that to our decorated \Noperations staff officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.47,0:12:09.90,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Show us what you've got, \NSergeant Major Kululu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.72,0:12:11.59,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(557.333,14)\3c&HD6AB82&\shad0\b1}Tss-tss
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.72,0:12:11.59,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\3c&HD6AB82&\shad0\b1\pos(200.667,96.667)}Tss-tss
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.72,0:12:11.59,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(70,234)\an5\fnArial\b1\c&HCA73BD&\3c&H8C4E93&\shad0}Boom\NBoom\NBoom
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.59,0:12:14.00,Italics,Tamama (M),0,0,0,,H-He's got such bad manners!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.59,0:12:14.00,Italics - Top,Keroro (M),0,0,0,,H-He's got such bad manners!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.53,0:12:17.76,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Um, Corporal Giroro?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.76,0:12:18.68,Main,Kululu,0,0,0,,Yes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:22.30,Main,Mois,0,0,0,,They're going through, \Nlike, some downs and ups!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.28,0:12:26.81,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Giroro's always been about as friendly \Nto him as a pooch to a primate!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.05,0:12:32.11,Main,Giroro,0,0,0,,I can accept the utility of music on \Nthe battlefield as a morale booster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.43,0:12:32.94,Main,Giroro,0,0,0,,That said,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.94,0:12:37.69,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(186,114)\b1\c&HD5BEFC&\3c&HFFFEFE&\4c&HE3A5F1&\fay-.05\fax.2\fs18\frz0.7747}Romance
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.94,0:12:37.69,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(231.333,238.667)\b1\c&H88F1FD&\3c&HFFFEFE&\4c&HE3A5F1&\fay-.05\fax.2\fs18\frz0.7747}I Love You
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.51,0:12:36.34,Main,Giroro,0,0,0,,what kind of namby-pamby, \Nreprobate garbage is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.34,0:12:39.46,Main,Giroro,0,0,0,,Romance and love, my ass! Put on \Na damn marching song instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.46,0:12:42.39,Main,Kululu,0,0,0,,Yeah, take a chill pill, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.39,0:12:45.17,Main,Kululu,0,0,0,,Isn't it past your bedtime anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.17,0:12:47.29,Main,Kululu,0,0,0,,Ku, ku ku!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.26,0:12:55.92,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(225,0)\pos(186,6)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&H0BB4DA&\3c&HE2E0DE&\shad0}Screech!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.66,0:12:54.11,Main,Kululu,0,0,0,,Here's a little lullaby to accompany \Nyou on your flight to heaven, dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.71,0:13:00.21,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,That's Kululu's special attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.21,0:13:02.99,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,He transmits the audio frequencies \Nhis opponents are most sensitive to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.99,0:13:04.80,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,directly into their brains, yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.80,0:13:06.47,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,For me, that would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.65,0:13:09.62,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(275,0)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&H1604B4&\3c&H69AFD5&\shad0\pos(518.667,190)}Squeak!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.65,0:13:09.62,Main,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(275,0)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&H1604B4&\3c&H69AFD5&\shad0\pos(116.667,206.667)}Squeak!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.74,0:13:09.39,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,the sound of styrofoam on styrofoam!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.39,0:13:10.79,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Agh! I can't take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.79,0:13:14.15,Main,Tamama,0,0,0,,F-For me, it's the sound of \Nnails on a chalkboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.79,0:13:15.75,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,0)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&H32A5BD&\3c&HBAE5EB&\shad0\pos(474.667,122.667)}Skree!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.15,0:13:15.77,Main,Tamama,0,0,0,,Make it stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.06,0:13:18.49,Main,Kululu,0,0,0,,By the way, Commander,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.24,0:13:22.14,Main,Kululu,0,0,0,,that operation of yours \Ndoesn't sound too shabby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.14,0:13:25.67,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,It doesn't? So you were \Nlistening after all, yes sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.67,0:13:26.95,Main,Kululu,0,0,0,,Ku, ku ku!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.32,0:13:31.21,Main,Kululu,0,0,0,,I'll get everything ready \Nfor ya in a week, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.21,0:13:33.67,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(295,120)\b1\c&HAD27DC&\bord0\4c&H1B1164&}He... He's on top of things...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.21,0:13:33.67,Italics,Tamama (M),0,0,0,,He... He's on top of things...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.21,0:13:33.67,Italics - Top,Mois (M),0,0,0,,He... He's on top of things...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.04,0:13:36.56,Main,Kululu,0,0,0,,You're countin' on my skills, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.56,0:13:39.63,Main,Kululu,0,0,0,,You can't get crap done without me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.63,0:13:42.87,Main,Kululu,0,0,0,,Such is the burden of genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.87,0:13:44.09,Main,Kululu,0,0,0,,Ku ku ku!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.09,0:13:47.31,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(295,135)\b1\c&H294CB1&\shad2\bord0\4c&HE9E1F0&}He... He's a total jerk...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.09,0:13:47.31,Italics,Tamama (M),0,0,0,,He... He's a total jerk...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.09,0:13:47.31,Italics - Top,Keroro (M),0,0,0,,He... He's a total jerk...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.31,0:13:49.55,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,A total jerk who is on top of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.55,0:13:52.35,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,That's Sergeant Major \NKululu in a nutshell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.35,0:13:54.60,sign_19957_289_One_Week_Later_,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,250)}One Week Later
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.84,0:13:57.16,Italics - Top,Radio,0,0,0,,Heard about that cold going around now? \NYou get a fever out of nowhere, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.55,0:14:00.05,Italics - Top,Radio,0,0,0,,Listen up, guys. You all gotta \Nwatch yourselves out there. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.05,0:14:01.77,Italics - Top,Radio,0,0,0,,Okay then. See you next week?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.12,0:14:06.32,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,It's almost time for \NMutsumi-san's radio show.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.40,0:14:15.00,Italics - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,It's time for {\i0}Sergeant Keroro's \NExtraordinary Dopamine!{\i1}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.00,0:14:18.21,Italics - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,Well, I guess we've started, haven't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.56,0:14:22.75,Italics - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,Good evening, ladies and gentlemen! \NI am radio personality Sergeant Keroro,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.75,0:14:23.47,Italics - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.94,0:14:25.78,Main,Kululu,0,0,0,,Ku, ku ku ku ku!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.78,0:14:28.07,Italics - Top,Mois,0,0,0,,And I'm his assistant, Princess Mois!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.07,0:14:30.81,Italics - Top,Tamama,0,0,0,,I'm radio producer Tamamacchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.07,0:14:30.81,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,210)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&H292725&\3c&HE4DDDA&\shad0}A Kululu Custom: Hinata Residence \NOffensive Radio Wave Broadcast Antenna
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.09,0:14:36.91,Italics - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,And we've got quite a show \Ncoming your way soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.91,0:14:39.11,Italics - Top,Mois,0,0,0,,You sure are dramatic tonight, Keroro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.11,0:14:42.32,Italics - Top,Tamama,0,0,0,,Come on, Giroro-senpai! \NStart dancing to pump everyone up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.50,0:14:42.32,Main,Staff,0,0,0,,Hey, they've hijacked the \Nbroadcast! Shut it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.35,0:14:49.16,Italics - Top,Giroro,0,0,0,,Get pumped up now! Get pumped up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.35,0:14:46.96,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's Kululu and the boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.96,0:14:49.16,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,Gotta hand it to them. \NThis is pretty cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.68,0:14:52.26,Italics - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,All righty, so, if you've got a \Nrequest or comment or something,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.26,0:14:54.02,Italics - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,feel free to send us a message!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.02,0:14:55.47,Italics - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,Great! See you next week!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.47,0:14:57.38,Italics - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,Muphwomp!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.17,0:14:59.99,Main,Tamama,0,0,0,,Nice job, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.17,0:14:59.21,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.99,0:15:01.80,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,To a job well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.80,0:15:04.82,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,It's such a good feeling when \Nwe put our heads together and
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.57,0:15:06.38,Main - Top,Giroro,0,0,0,,Why the hell am I the \None who has to dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.82,0:15:06.38,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,accomplish a big goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.38,0:15:07.75,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Radio is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.79,0:15:09.11,Main - Top,Giroro,0,0,0,,Don't treat me like the stooge, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.75,0:15:08.77,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.85,0:15:10.56,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Gero!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.56,0:15:12.15,Main,Giroro,0,0,0,,N-Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.15,0:15:18.47,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,You know, I {\i1}really{\i0} look forward \Nto Mutsumi-san's show every week.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.47,0:15:24.32,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,I even saved up my allowance to buy a \Nradio so I could listen in real time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.36,0:15:28.53,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Once {\i1}Sergeant Keroro's \NExtraordinary Dopamine!{\i0} succeeds
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.53,0:15:31.25,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,in rendering all Pekoponian \Nlisteners completely spineless,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.25,0:15:33.79,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Pekopon will be ours for \Nthe taking, yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.79,0:15:35.24,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Since that's happening no matter what,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.24,0:15:38.65,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,you might wanna start kissing up \Nto me now while you can, yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.65,0:15:41.27,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Gero, gero gero gero gero gero ge—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.69,0:15:47.53,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Officer... Natsumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.18,0:15:53.26,Main,Mois,0,0,0,,She's, like, a blazing inferno!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.52,0:16:01.27,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,Mom's out of town for work and won't \Nbe back until tomorrow evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.64,0:16:03.93,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,And it's too late to go to a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.60,0:16:09.20,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,If you dare call an ambulance, \NI'll beat you to a pulp.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.99,0:16:13.05,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,I totally hate hospitals!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.46,0:16:19.50,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,Who do you think I am, anyway? \NI'm still your big sis, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.55,0:16:22.61,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,Sis...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.28,0:16:26.02,Italics,Fuyuki (M),0,0,0,,You're right, Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.02,0:16:28.53,Italics,Fuyuki (M),0,0,0,,You're always the one watching out for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.53,0:16:31.01,Italics,Fuyuki (M),0,0,0,,This time it's my turn to watch over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.31,0:16:35.35,Main,Giroro,0,0,0,,Hmph! I guess you aren't such a hotshot \Nif that's all it takes to knock you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.35,0:16:39.25,Main,Giroro,0,0,0,,There's no way you'd survive \Nall-out galactic war.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.46,0:16:44.52,Main,Kululu,0,0,0,,Ku, ku ku ku ku ku ku ku ku ku ku!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.43,0:16:58.64,Main,Giroro,0,0,0,,Don't you dare die on me, Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.55,0:17:01.92,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,It's getting late, so why don't \Nyou guys go get some rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.45,0:17:05.71,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,Thanks. But don't worry, \NI'll keep an eye on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.83,0:17:15.26,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Officer Fuyuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.64,0:17:17.35,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,As representative of those responsible
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.35,0:17:19.34,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,for causing Officer Natsumi such distress,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.34,0:17:23.22,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,I would like your permission \Nto assist in her care, yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.86,0:17:25.38,Italics,Fuyuki (M),0,0,0,,Sergeant...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.38,0:17:26.90,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,Very well! You have my permission!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.27,0:17:30.36,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Much obliged, Commanding Officer Fuyuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.75,0:17:50.69,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,Nothing's working. \NThe fever isn't going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.98,0:17:54.06,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,Giroro?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.06,0:17:59.29,Main,Giroro,0,0,0,,I brought the liver of a space kerberos. \NThey say it can cure any ailment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.29,0:18:00.64,Main,Giroro,0,0,0,,I... got it for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.01,0:18:03.68,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,What is that delicious smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.68,0:18:07.52,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Oh! You prepared my breakfast, yes sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.28,0:18:15.91,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Whoa! My back pain, stiff shoulders, \Nchronic fatigue, and eye strain
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.34,0:18:17.01,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,900)\pos(540,229.333)\an5\b1\c&H116F49&\3c&H97DDD7&\shad0\frx30\fry0\frz346.1}Back Pain
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.84,0:18:17.01,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,900)\an5\b1\c&H80474B&\3c&HC2D7E1&\shad0\frz7.385\frx10\fry12\pos(142,221.34)}Stiff Shoulders
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.84,0:18:17.01,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,900)\an5\b1\c&H756812&\3c&HD2F3DE&\shad0\frx30\fry0\pos(108.67,111.33)\frz16.16}Chronic Fatigue
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.84,0:18:17.01,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,900)\an5\b1\c&H0A5378&\3c&HECE3D7&\shad0\frx30\fry0\frz342.7\pos(424,74.67)}Eye Strain
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.91,0:18:17.74,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,are all disappearing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.74,0:18:20.72,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,775)\pos(320,350)\an2\fnArial\b1\c&HA52578&\3c&HDBE1D2&\4c&H59B551&\shad2}An unexpected super power up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.01,0:18:19.29,Main - Top,Giroro,0,0,0,,How dare...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.79,0:18:21.89,Main - Top,Giroro,0,0,0,,Damn you! Damn you! Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.76,0:18:22.26,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(75,0)\pos(139.33,116.67)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&H262424&\3c&HDAD6E2&\shad0}Pop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.60,0:18:28.14,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,Sergeant! Giroro went out and got \Nthat to help my sister get better!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.14,0:18:29.75,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.27,0:18:34.22,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,I did think it was a little \Nextravagant for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.51,0:18:37.63,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,I didn't have any idea! \NI didn't mean to cause trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.63,0:18:40.59,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,My best wishes for Officer \NNatsumi to be better
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.59,0:18:43.67,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,are even crazier than a \Ncaptured kerberos's liver!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.67,0:18:46.73,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,There's no way the wishes \Nof the frog-shaped alien
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.94,0:18:51.15,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,who scarfed down Natsumi's medicine in \None bite would ever help her feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.15,0:18:53.37,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.76,0:19:06.62,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(650,0)\c&H836561&\3c&HF8F6F4&\shad0\fs16\frx10\fry18\fay.18\move(308,138,308,98)\t(\fs12)}Please leave me alone
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.34,0:19:04.57,Main,Mois,0,0,0,,He's locked in there with Kululu-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.57,0:19:06.62,Main,Mois,0,0,0,,I guess, like, barricaded?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.62,0:19:11.71,Main,Tamama,0,0,0,,Or maybe planning the next stage of \Nthe radio brainwashing operation?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.55,0:19:14.89,Italics - Top,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,It's {\i0}Mutsumi's Me Radio{\i1}!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.89,0:19:15.55,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,Hey Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.03,0:19:18.18,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,They're airing a make-up \Nbroadcast of Mutsumi-san's show
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.18,0:19:20.47,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,since it was hijacked yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.31,0:19:23.19,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,This ought to make you feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.79,0:19:27.09,Italics - Top,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,All right, since we're broadcasting \Nat a special time today,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.09,0:19:30.23,Italics - Top,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,let's start off with a special version \Nof our kick-off poem as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.17,0:19:33.65,Italics - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,Since it's too late for I'm sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.65,0:19:37.49,Italics - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,at least today let me give you a smile \Nand say thanks for dinner. Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.81,0:19:39.78,Italics - Top,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,Huh? That sounds like...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.78,0:19:42.63,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,Right off the bat, you're \Ndropping truth bombs!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.63,0:19:44.08,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,That poem sounded like
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.08,0:19:47.37,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,it was written with your feelings \Nfor someone very special.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.03,0:19:52.79,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Yes. I did something very \Ncruel to that person.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.12,0:19:57.30,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,I could apologize all day, but I \Ndon't think she would accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.93,0:20:00.55,Italics - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,I don't think she would listen at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.98,0:20:05.06,Italics - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,But I still want her to \Nunderstand that I mean it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.06,0:20:09.87,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,That person actually loves this \Nradio show, Officer Mutsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.87,0:20:13.05,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,So I thought, maybe, if I'm lucky...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.05,0:20:15.63,Main,Mutsumi,0,0,0,,If you wanna get through, you gotta \Nopen up more than that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.63,0:20:16.41,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.50,0:20:22.44,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,The small words "thank you" hiding in my \Nheart, as they grow bigger and bigger,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.44,0:20:24.93,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,start to tickle me relentlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.27,0:20:29.25,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,It can be hard to bring words out of \Ntheir shell, don't you think? Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.93,0:20:34.00,Italics - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,If all of the lights in the universe \Ncould join as one and shine together,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.28,0:20:38.70,Italics - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,they would still not shine as \Nbrightly as the precious miracle
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.70,0:20:42.19,Italics - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,that brought us together on this \Npuny little planet. Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.83,0:20:45.35,Italics - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,The "N" in Natsumi means \Nyou're a natural winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.35,0:20:48.08,Italics - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,The "S" means you're surely \Nstrong enough to recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.08,0:20:51.19,Italics - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,The "M" is for Matilda dying on the Medea!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.59,0:20:56.22,Italics - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,Dear Shizuoka Factory, please \Nrelease an EX model of the FanFan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.22,0:21:00.19,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,I told you that's a product \Nrequest, not a poem.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.62,0:21:01.78,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.14,0:21:06.62,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.62,0:21:08.77,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Well? How is Natsumi doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.52,0:21:11.71,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,You totally hijacked \NMutsumi-san's radio show
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.14,0:21:15.04,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,and I'm not gonna let you get \Naway with it! Stupid frog!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.39,0:21:17.92,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,Gero gero ge, yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.92,0:21:20.69,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Um, what about your cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.03,0:21:24.10,Main,Fuyuki,0,0,0,,One of the sergeant's friends \Ncooked up a special cold medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.47,0:21:26.61,Main,Kululu,0,0,0,,You must be the honey girl's pretty mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.61,0:21:31.77,Main,Kululu,0,0,0,,Wanna surf my cool grooves and start \Nvibin', babe? Ku, ku ku ku ku ku!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.77,0:21:35.97,Main,Giroro,0,0,0,,It seems like Kululu set up \NKeroro's radio appearance as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.97,0:21:36.82,Main,Giroro,0,0,0,,Darn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.82,0:21:39.94,Main,Giroro,0,0,0,,And here I thought you were diligently \Nplanning out our next operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.16,0:21:43.35,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,I'll even ask Kululu to get \NOfficer Mutsumi's autograph for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.35,0:21:44.86,Main,Keroro,0,0,0,,so please don't hurt me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.86,0:21:48.20,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,I hate it so much when you try to weasel \Nyour way out of things like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.20,0:21:50.79,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,Stop running from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.00,0:21:50.79,Main - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,I know you really want it though!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.79,0:21:54.55,Sign_Basic,Credits,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,10)\fs16\fnArial\b1\shad0}Translation: Michael Arnold\NTiming: Andy Ellis\NEditing: Zachary Carlysle\NQuality Control: S. Bilyeu\NFinal Quality Control: Elizabeth Ellis
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.46,0:23:25.34,Italics - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,It's time for {\i0}Sergeant Keroro's \NExtraordinary Dopamine!{\i1}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.34,0:23:29.51,Italics - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,All right. Our next letter is from \NNat-chan in Tokyo who just loves frogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.93,0:23:33.06,Italics - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,"Recently, my roommate isn't \Nhelping out with chores at all
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.06,0:23:35.69,Italics - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,but I don't know the best way \Nto talk to him about it."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.69,0:23:38.99,Italics - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,Ah, of course, of course. \NI know that feeling well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.99,0:23:43.93,Italics - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,Okay, next time is "Is it a Cavity? \NNo, It's the Caries War"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.31,0:23:50.74,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(66,65)\shad0\bord1.5\fs20}Next Time
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.31,0:23:50.74,Ep_Title,text,0,0,0,,{\b1\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\pos(320,160)}Is It a {\c&HFB93E0&\3c&HA51072&}Cavity{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&}? No, It's {\c&HFB93E0&\3c&HA51072&}the Caries War
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.31,0:23:50.74,Ep_Title,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H2870F4&\3c&H2AC7ED&\b1\pos(320,215)}Aki {\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&}Becomes a Middle Schooler
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.93,0:23:46.20,Italics - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,along with "Aki Becomes \Na Middle Schooler."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.20,0:23:49.69,Italics - Top,Keroro,0,0,0,,Ah, of course! She becomes one. \NShe really does!

